  "description": "The Skream Magnum Titanium Custom Series is a personal passion project from our founders, rooted in over 15 years of riding experience. It represents a shift from mass production toward a more intentional craft—marrying the lifelong durability of titanium with hand-finished, experimental aesthetics.\n\nAs a high-performance evolution of our successful Magnum geometry, these frames are engineered to be faster and more responsive for the demands of the road. We produced this limited run of only 20 individually numbered pieces as a tribute to the community that has supported Skream from day one. Each frame is a unique piece of our history, built for those who demand both technical performance and true craftsmanship.",
